l styling for active target, hint display, and hover effects.\n\n\nPalette item implementation confirms the `draggable` attribute, `cursor-grab`, and a visual drag handle. The design correctly uses `pointer-events-none` on internal elements to prevent interference with drag events. Drop zone visual cues are active when hovered, confirming drop zone behavior. I see drop zone components within the \"if\" block, likely to manage nested block placement within the conditional slots.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"view_file","args":{"AbsolutePath":"\"e:\\\\codekids\\\\src\\\\components\\\\mission\\\\BlockEditor.tsx\"","EndLine":"80","StartLine":"1","toolAction":"\"Viewing BlockEditor.tsx lines 1-80\"","toolSummary":"\"View BlockEditor.tsx lines 1-80\""}}]}
